{"step_index":97,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-13T19:45:10Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Deep research report synthesizing findings from 3 parallel research agents on where to buy cheap MacBook Pro with Apple Silicon, 32GB RAM, 512GB/1TB in India. Covers: refurbished platforms (Cashify, Sahivalue, CeX, Amazon Renewed), new-but-discounted routes (Unicorn Store clearance, Vijay Sales bank offers), AppleCare+ eligibility rules for used Macs, a cross-platform price comparison matrix, and a buyer inspection checklist. Includes counter-arguments and risk warnings.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Where to Buy Cheap MacBook Pro (Apple Silicon, 32GB) in India\\n\\n> **Research Date**: 14 September 2026 | **Method**: 3 parallel research agents, cross-validated | **Sources**: 15+ platforms scraped\\n\\n---\\n\\n## TL;DR — The Short Answer\\n\\n| Route | Best Platform | Price Range (32GB, 512GB–1TB) | AppleCare? | Risk |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| 🏆 **New sealed, previous gen** | **Unicorn Store clearance** | ₹1,55,000–₹2,14,000 (25–35% off) | ✅ Yes (full) | Zero |\\n| 💰 **Refurbished (best value)** | **Cashify / Sahivalue** | ₹1,10,000–₹1,65,000 | ❌ No | Low |\\n| 🛡️ **Refurbished (best warranty)** | **CeX India** | ₹1,25,000–₹1,55,000 | ❌ No (but 2-yr CeX warranty) | Low |\\n| 🔥 **New current gen, discounted** | **Vijay Sales + HDFC EMI** | ₹1,85,000–₹2,25,000 | ✅ Yes (full) | Zero |\\n| ⚠️ **Cheapest absolute price** | **TechEnclave / classifieds** | ₹90,000–₹1,25,000 | ❌ Almost never | Medium-High |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## The Hard Truth About AppleCare+ on Used Macs\\n\\n> [!CAUTION]\\n> **AppleCare+ can only be bought within 60 days of the ORIGINAL first sale date** — not from when YOU buy the used Mac. Third-party invoices from Cashify, Amazon, etc. do NOT reset this clock.\\n\\n| Scenario | Can You Buy AppleCare+? |\\n|---|---|\\n| Mac is <60 days old from original Apple/APR sale | ✅ Yes — buy via System Settings or call Apple |\\n| Mac is >60 days old | ❌ No — permanently ineligible |\\n| Previous owner bought 3-year upfront AppleCare+ | ✅ Transfers automatically with serial number |\\n| Previous owner has monthly AppleCare+ subscription | ❌ Non-transferable, dies when they cancel |\\n\\n**AppleCare+ pricing in India:**\\n- 14\\\" MacBook Pro: **₹29,900** (3-yr) or **₹999/month**\\n- 16\\\" MacBook Pro: **₹40,900** (3-yr) or **₹1,379/month**\\n\\n**Bottom line:** If AppleCare+ matters to you, buy **new** (sealed clearance from Unicorn or current gen from Vijay Sales). On refurbished, you're stuck with the seller's 6-month warranty.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Platform-by-\n<truncated 5619 bytes>","Description":"\"Final synthesized deep research report from 3 parallel subagents covering cheap MacBook Pro buying options in India.\"","Overwrite":"false","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\renu5\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\b764a5db-2187-47e2-b019-8f596935f002\\\\cheap-macbook-pro-india-guide.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating final research report\"","toolSummary":"\"Final research artifact\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
