{"step_index":122,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"SYSTEM_MESSAGE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T09:48:27Z","content":"The following is a <SYSTEM_MESSAGE> not actually sent by the user. It is provided by the system as important information to pay attention to.\n\n<SYSTEM_MESSAGE>\n[Message] timestamp=2026-09-14T09:48:27Z sender=e6fa4ac5-b2f1-4ee1-9402-8fad8fb14aa8 priority=MESSAGE_PRIORITY_HIGH content=# Comprehensive Research Report: Apple Premium Resellers & Authorised Resellers in India (MacBook Pro Deals, Clearance & Student Offers)\n\n### Executive Summary\nThis research evaluates all major Apple Premium Resellers (APRs), Apple Premium Partners (APPs), and Apple Authorised Resellers (AARs) in India with active online storefronts. The evaluation focuses on:\n1. **Deals, Offers, or Clearance sections**\n2. **Student/Education pricing pages & Back-to-School programs**\n3. **MacBook Pro models on discount and pricing (in INR)**\n4. **Reseller status and verification requirements**\n\n---\n\n### Comparison Matrix of Resellers\n\n| Reseller / Store | Type / Region | Website URL | Deals / Clearance Section? | Student / Education Page? | Back-to-School / Student Offer? | MacBook Pro Pricing / Discounts |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Aptronix** | Apple Premium Partner (Pan-India) | [aptronixindia.com](https://www.aptronixindia.com) | **Yes** (Offers page & bank cashbacks) | **Yes** (\"Back to Cool\" portal) | **Yes** (Up to 8-10% off Mac + accessories + AppleCare) | 14\" MBP: ₹2,20,708 (MRP ₹2,39,900) + ₹15,000 bank cashback |\n| **Imagine (Tresor Systems)** | Apple Premium Partner (North/West) | [myimaginestore.com](https://www.myimaginestore.com) | **Yes** (Promotional Offers) | **Yes** (Dedicated Student Offer) | **Yes** (~7% edu discount + bank cashback) | 14\" MBP: Net effective ₹2,08,107 (MRP ₹2,39,900); 16\" MBP: ₹3,19,707 |\n| **Imagine (Ample Technologies)** | Apple Premium Partner (South/Online) | [imagineonline.store](https://www.imagineonline.store) | **Yes** (Offers & Timeless Tech Sale) | **Yes** (Student & Teacher Discounts) | **Yes** (Edu rates + bank cashback + EMI) | 14\" & 16\" MBP configurations with \n<truncated 10872 bytes>\ns. Dedicated page at [icreststore.in/apple-student-discount-offers/](https://icreststore.in/apple-student-discount-offers/).\n*   **Student / Back-to-School Offers:** Verification via consent form and document upload (college ID / fee receipt / admission letter).\n\n#### 11. IndiaiStore (Aggregator Platform for Authorized APRs)\n*   **Website:** [indiaistore.com](https://www.indiaistore.com)\n*   **Role:** Official distributor platform (Redington & Ingram Micro) connecting 3,000+ reseller outlets.\n*   **Deals & Student Info:** Hosts official nationwide bank cashback campaigns (Axis, ICICI, SBI) offering ₹10,000 to ₹15,000 cashback, trade-in calculators, and links to local APR student events.\n\n#### 12. Clarifications on Specific Queries:\n*   **Maple Store ([maplestore.in](https://maplestore.in)):** While historically an Apple Premium Reseller in Mumbai, its online storefront is now focused on **Certified Pre-Owned Apple devices** (graded units with 32-step quality check and limited warranty) rather than brand-new inventory with education pricing.\n*   **iBerry ([iberryservice.in](https://iberryservice.in)):** iBerry is **NOT** an Apple Authorized Reseller or APR. It is an independent, non-authorized third-party repair provider based in Bengaluru.\n\n---\n\n### Key Recommendations for Maximum Savings\n1. **Best Clearance Deals on Brand-New Units:** Check **Unicorn Store's \"Hot Deals\"** section ([shop.unicornstore.in](https://shop.unicornstore.in)) for sealed previous-gen MacBook Pro models discounted by 25%–35%.\n2. **Best Documented Online Student Pricing:** **Imagine Store (Tresor Systems)** and **Aptronix** offer transparent online student discount portals (~7% to 10% base discount) that stack with ₹10,000–₹15,000 bank cashbacks.\n3. **Official Apple Education Alternative:** Apple India's official Back-to-School program ([apple.com/in-edu/shop](https://www.apple.com/in-edu/shop)) provides up to ₹12,900 off on MacBook Pro models along with complimentary AirPods bundles via UNiDAYS verification.\n</SYSTEM_MESSAGE>","truncated_fields":["content"]}
