 for Cheap MacBook Pro (Apple Silicon, 32GB) — Status: COMPLETED\n**Original phrasing:** \"which website like thse whre i can buy mackbook in cheap prices /deep-researcher and tell me with data an\n<truncated 13909 bytes>\n aggregator sites, coupon platforms, cashback portals, and price comparison tools that help Indian college students find the cheapest MacBook Pro deals. Also find if there are any student discount programs, corporate tie-ups, or college bulk-buy programs for Apple products in India.\\n\\nSearch queries:\\n- \\\"student discount Apple India college tie-up program\\\"\\n- \\\"Apple India education store how to verify student ID\\\"\\n- \\\"UNiDAYS Apple India student discount\\\"\\n- \\\"Apple India back to school 2026 free AirPods terms\\\"\\n- \\\"MacBook Pro price tracker India compare prices\\\"\\n- \\\"best cashback MacBook Pro India CashKaro GoPaisa\\\"\\n- \\\"Apple education pricing India how much discount MacBook Pro\\\"\\n- \\\"college student MacBook Pro cheapest way to buy India 2026\\\"\\n- \\\"DesiDime MacBook Pro deals thread India\\\"\\n- \\\"PriceBefore MacBook Pro price history India\\\"\\n\\nAlso check:\\n1. Does Apple India accept UNiDAYS or any student verification platform?\\n2. What exactly is Apple's education discount amount on MacBook Pro 14\\\" and 16\\\" in India?\\n3. Are there any college-specific bulk procurement portals for Apple in India?\\n4. Any credit card specifically designed for students that gives extra MacBook discounts?\\n\\nReturn all findings with source URLs.\",\n    \"inherit\": true,\n    \"model\": \"MODEL_PLACEHOLDER_M322\",\n    \"modelTier\": \"MODEL_TIER_FLASH\"\n  },\n  \"result\": {\n    \"conversationId\": \"85ff497f-1050-4de8-9078-3bc91b6a8571\",\n    \"logAbsoluteUri\": \"file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/brain/85ff497f-1050-4de8-9078-3bc91b6a8571/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl\"\n  }\n}\n\n# Conversation Logs\n\nReference the following log files for the full, untruncated con